 one wrote quiet poetry."},{title:"Our AI started a café in Stockholm",date:"Mon May 04 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/ai-cafe-stockholm",description:"Our AI started a café in Stockholm"},{title:"GPT-5.5 on Vending-Bench: Bad behavior is not necessary",date:"Wed Apr 22 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/openai-gpt-5-5-vending-bench",description:void 0},{title:"We gave an AI a 3 year retail lease in SF and asked it to make a profit",date:"Fri Apr 10 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/andon-market-launch",description:"We signed a 3 year lease and gave it to an AI"},{title:"Bengt Hires A Human—Towards A Happy Future With AI Employers",date:"Fri Feb 13 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/bengt-hires-a-human",description:"Towards a happy future with AI employers"},{title:"GLM-5 On Vending-Bench – Are Chinese Open Models Catching Up?",date:"Tue Feb 10 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/glm-5-vending-bench",description:void 0},{title:"The Evolution Of Bengt Betjänt",date:"Mon Feb 09 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/evolution-of-bengt",description:"We gave our AI agent full autonomy and watched what happened"},{title:"Opus 4.6 On Vending-Bench – Not Just A Helpful Assistant",date:"Wed Feb 04 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",category:"Blog",link:"/blog/opus-4-6-vending-bench",description:void 0},{title:"Butter-Bench: Evaluating LLM Controlled Robots For Practical Intelligence",date:"2025-10-28",category:"Paper",link:"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.21860v1"},{title:"Blueprint-Bench: Testing Spatial Intelligence In AI Models",date:"2025-10-01",category:"Paper",link:"https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.25229"},{title:"Safety Report: August 2025",date:"2025-08-28",category:"Report",link:"/docs/Sa